{
  "name": "PK-Bascule-Modele",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "bascule-modele",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook bascule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -300,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "predicare-bascule-modele",
      "notes": "Appele par api-inference apres une bascule reussie (`POST /api/inference/modele/bascule`). URL interne : http://n8n:5678/webhook/bascule-modele. Repond en moins de 2 s : api-inference abandonne la notification au-dela, sans jamais annuler la bascule."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "version-apres-presente",
              "leftValue": "={{ !!($json.body && $json.body.version_apres) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Valider la bascule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -60,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Sans `version_apres`, la notification serait vide : on refuse la charge."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Repondre OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        180,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Repond AVANT Slack/e-mail : api-inference n'attend pas la notification."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "rawContentType": "application/json",
        "body": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: '🔁 *Bascule de modèle* — v' + ($('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.version_avant || 'aucune') + ' → v' + $('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.version_apres + '\\nActeur : ' + ($('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.acteur || 'appel direct') + '\\n' + $('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.timestamp }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Notifier Slack bascule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        -120
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "notes": "Meme webhook entrant Slack que l'alerte fraude, sans scope OAuth. Le corps DOIT etre un objet `{ text }` serialise : un texte brut fait repondre `400 invalid_payload` a Slack."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.SMTP_FROM }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $env.SMTP_GESTIONNAIRE }}",
        "subject": "={{ '🔁 Bascule de modèle — v' + ($('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.version_avant || 'aucune') + ' → v' + $('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.version_apres }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "options": {},
        "text": "={{ 'Nouvelle version active : v' + $('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.version_apres + '\\nVersion precedente : v' + ($('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.version_avant || 'aucune') + '\\nActeur : ' + ($('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.acteur || 'appel direct') + '\\nHorodatage : ' + $('Webhook bascule').first().json.body.timestamp }}"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Notifier par e-mail bascule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        680,
        -120
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "notes": "Lit la charge du webhook par son NOM, pas `$json` : le noeud precedent est Slack, donc `$json` ne contient que sa reponse.",
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "MailpitDev000001",
          "name": "Mailpit (dev)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "notification-bascule-en-echec",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Notifier Slack bascule').first().json.error !== undefined || $json.error !== undefined }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Notification en echec ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        920,
        -120
      ],
      "notes": "Une panne Slack n'empeche pas l'e-mail ; l'echec est journalise apres coup."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "Notification de bascule en echec : Slack ou e-mail n'a pas pu etre envoye. La bascule reste appliquee."
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Notification en echec",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        -180
      ],
      "notes": "Marque l'execution n8n en `error`. La bascule, elle, est deja faite."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Notifications envoyees",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\n  \"detail\": \"version_apres requis\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 422
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Repondre 422",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        180,
        160
      ],
      "notes": "Charge invalide : api-inference journalise l'echec et continue."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "Bascule invalide : `version_apres` est absent de la charge."
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Bascule invalide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
